{"sha": "7aa0cb0c096cf2aaa39af63778c8e692fb3dcaaf409089daf65f0affa859c4e1", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:powerseries:8}", "二项级数：$\\sqrt{1-4x} = \\sum_{k\\geq0}", "\\binom{1/2}{k}(-4x)^k$。当 $k = n + 1 \\geq 1$ 时：", "\\begin{align*}", "\\binom{1/2}{n+1}(-4)^{n+1}", "&= \\frac{\\frac12\\bigl(\\frac12 - 1\\bigr)\\cdots\\bigl(\\frac12 -", "n\\bigr)}{(n+1)!}\\,(-4)^{n+1}\\\\", "&= \\frac{(-1)^n\\,1\\cdot3\\cdots(2n-1)}{2^{n+1}(n+1)!}\\,(-4)^{n+1}", "= -\\frac{2}{n+1}\\cdot\\frac{(2n)!}{n!\\,n!} ,", "\\end{align*}", "利用 $1\\cdot3\\cdots(2n-1) = \\frac{(2n)!}{2^n n!}$。于是", "\\[", "C(x) = \\frac{1 - \\sqrt{1-4x}}{2x}", "= \\frac{1}{2x}\\sum_{n\\geq0}\\frac{2}{n+1}\\binom{2n}{n}x^{n+1}", "= \\sum_{n\\geq0} \\frac{1}{n+1}\\binom{2n}{n}\\,x^n :", "\\]", "$C_n = \\frac{1}{n+1}\\binom{2n}{n}$。收敛半径为 $\\frac14$（二项", "级数中的自变量为 $4x$）。渐近性由", "\\cref{ex:b2:comparison:centralbinomial}可得：", "\\[", "C_n \\sim \\frac{4^n}{\\sqrt{\\pi}\\; n^{3/2}} .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:powerseries:9}", "设 $A_n = \\sum_{k \\leq n} a_k \\to A$，由阿贝尔求和得，对", "$0 \\leq x < 1$，", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} a_n x^n = (1 - x)\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} A_n x^n", "\\]", "（两边均收敛：$(A_n)$ 有界；恒等式由", "$a_n = A_n - A_{n-1}$ 及重新编号可得）。又由 $(1 -", "x)\\sum x^n = 1$:", "\\[", "\\sum_n a_nx^n - A = (1-x)\\sum_{n} (A_n - A)x^n .", "\\]", "给定 $\\varepsilon$，选 $N$，使得 $\\abs{A_n - A} \\leq", "\\varepsilon$ 对 $n > N$ 成立；于是", "\\[", "\\Bigl|\\sum a_nx^n - A\\Bigr|", "\\leq (1-x)\\sum_{n \\leq N}\\abs{A_n - A} + \\varepsilon(1 -", "x)\\sum_{n > N}x^n", "\\leq (1-x)\\,C_N + \\varepsilon ,", "\\]", "令 $x \\to 1^-$，得 limsup $\\leq \\varepsilon$，对所有", "$\\varepsilon$ 成立。因此径向极限为 $A$。", "", "应用：$\\sum \\frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{n}$ 收敛（交错级数），", "且当 $x < 1$ 时其幂级数之和为 $\\ln(1 + x)$。由阿贝尔定理，", "其和为 $\\ln 2$。类似地，$\\sum\\frac{(-1)^n}{2n+1}x^{2n+1} =", "\\arctan x$ 得 $\\frac\\pi4$（$x = 1$ 时）--- 本科一年级分册中的积分", "证明，如今有了结构性的解释。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:powerseries:10}", "两级数 $\\sum\\frac{x^n}{n}$ 与 $\\sum\\frac{x^n}{n+1}$ 的收敛半径均为", "$1$，且 $\\frac{1}{n(n+1)} = \\frac1n - \\frac1{n+1}$，故当 $0", "< \\abs x < 1$ 时：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{x^n}{n(n+1)}", "= -\\ln(1-x) - \\frac1x\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}", "= -\\ln(1-x) - \\frac{-\\ln(1-x) - x}{x}", "= 1 + \\frac{1-x}{x}\\ln(1-x) .", "\\]", "收敛半径为 $1$；并且 $\\norm{x^n/(n(n+1))}_{\\infty,\\intcc{-1}1} =", "\\frac{1}{n(n+1)}$ 可和，故在", "$\\intcc{-1}{1}$ 上正规收敛，从而和函数在该处连续。当 $x \\to", "1^-$ 时，$(1-x)\\ln(1-x) \\to 0$，闭式趋于 $1$ ---", "与裂项求和的结果一致：$\\sum\\frac{1}{n(n+1)} =", "\\lim_N\\bigl(1 - \\frac{1}{N+1}\\bigr) = 1$，即 $x = 1$ 时的值。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:powerseries:11}", "按不动点集合将 $n!$ 个置换分类：选取", "$k$ 个不动点（$\\binom nk$ 种方式），并对其余", "$n - k$ 个对象作错排，得 $n! = \\sum_{k=0}^n\\binom nk D_{n-k}$。", "两边除以 $n!$：", "\\[", "1 = \\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\frac{1}{k!}\\cdot\\frac{D_{n-k}}{(n-k)!} ,", "\\]", "这恰好说明 $\\eu^x =", "\\sum\\frac{x^k}{k!}$ 与 $D(x) = \\sum D_n\\frac{x^n}{n!}$ 的柯西乘积为", "$\\sum x^n = \\frac{1}{1-x}$。两因子在", "$\\abs x < 1$ 时绝对收敛（$D_n \\leq n!$，故 $D$ 受几何级数", "控制）：乘积恒等式成立", "（\\cref{prop:b2:powerseries:operations}），且", "\\[", "D(x) = \\frac{\\eu^{-x}}{1-x} .", "\\]", "考虑 $\\eu^{-x} = \\sum\\frac{(-1)^kx^k}{k!}$ 与", "$\\sum x^m$ 的柯西乘积中，$x^n$ 的系数为", "$\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\frac{(-1)^k}{k!}$，由幂级数", "系数的唯一性（\\cref{thm:b2:powerseries:calculus}）可得：", "\\[", "\\frac{D_n}{n!} = \\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\frac{(-1)^k}{k!}", "\\xrightarrow[n\\to\\infty]{} \\eu^{-1} :", "\\]", "约 $37\\%$ 的置换都是错排，且这一比例", "与 $n$ 无关。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:powerseries:12}", "二项级数，取 $\\alpha = -\\frac12$，自变量为 $-4x$：", "\\[", "\\binom{-1/2}{n}(-4)^n", "= \\frac{\\bigl(-\\frac12\\bigr)\\bigl(-\\frac32\\bigr)\\cdots", "\\bigl(-\\frac{2n-1}2\\bigr)}{n!}(-4)^n", "= \\frac{1\\cdot3\\cdots(2n-1)}{2^n\\,n!}\\,4^n", "= \\frac{(2n)!}{2^n n!}\\cdot\\frac{2^n}{n!}", "= \\binom{2n}{n},", "\\]", "利用 $1\\cdot3\\cdots(2n-1) = \\frac{(2n)!}{2^nn!}$。于是", "$(1-4x)^{-1/2} = \\sum\\binom{2n}nx^n$ 对 $\\abs{4x} < 1$ 成立。", "将其平方（柯西乘积，由绝对收敛性可以保证）", "并与 $\\frac{1}{1-4x} = \\sum 4^nx^n$ 比较：", "平方后 $x^n$ 的系数为", "$\\sum_{k=0}^n\\binom{2k}k\\binom{2n-2k}{n-k}$，由", "系数的唯一性可得：", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom{2k}{k}\\binom{2n-2k}{n-k} = 4^n .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", ""]}